    "progressSummary": "COMPLETED: Proved snf_1x2_invariant_factor — the 1×2 SNF invariant factor is associated to gcd(a,b). File now has 0 sorries, 2 axioms.",
    "builtItems": [
      "Proved snf_1x2_invariant_factor (BezoutIdentityOQ04OQ01.lean)"
