    "nextSteps": [
      "Implement the matrix entry extraction: congr_fun (congr_fun hsnf 0) j for j=0,1",
      "Use snf.hD_diag 0 1 (by omega) for D 0 1 = 0",
      "Use Matrix.det_fin_two for det(V) = V 0 0 * V 1 1 - V 0 1 * V 1 0",
      "dvd_gcd for Part 1, dvd_sub + dvd_mul for Part 2"
    ]
